From: Andy Zhang and contributors (see kernel/third-party/README.md for imported parts)
Subject: [PATCH 0004/8] Xiaomi sky DSI panel and KTD3136 backlight drivers

panel-xiaomi-sky.c: DSI video-mode DSC panel written for this project (timings and init sequence read from the phone's own dtbo).
ktd3136.c: KTD3136 backlight (I2C 0x36), imported from sky-linux (GPL-2.0).

Apply with: git apply (from the root of a Linux 7.3 tree).
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
index cbdf7b8f7..d3832f66f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
@@ -1352,6 +1352,17 @@ config DRM_PANEL_VISIONOX_G2647FB105
 	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for the Visionox
 	  G2647FB105 (2340x1080@60Hz) AMOLED DSI cmd mode panel.
 
+config DRM_PANEL_XIAOMI_SKY
+	tristate "Xiaomi Redmi 12 5G (sky) DSI DSC panel"
+	depends on OF
+	depends on DRM_MIPI_DSI
+	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
